      "extractedText": "VEYSTRIX FREEWARE LICENSE AGREEMENT\nDraft v0.1 \u2014 2026-11-10\n\nDRAFT FOR LEGAL REVIEW. This text has not been reviewed by a lawyer. The owner\nmust complete the bracketed fields and have the whole agreement reviewed before\nthe first public release is announced.\n\nVeystrix is proprietary software that is free to download and use. It is NOT\nopen-source software. Some components inside it are open source and remain\nunder their own licenses (see \"Third-party components\" below and the file\nTHIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).\n\n1. PARTIES AND DEFINITIONS\n\n\"Licensor\" means [OWNER LEGAL NAME / TRADING NAME], the owner of the Veystrix\ncomponents identified in section 6.\n\n\"Software\" means the Veystrix macOS application and the Veystrix inference\nengine helper bundled inside it, in the unmodified form published by the\nLicensor as an \"Official Build\" at\nhttps://github.com/joyboyreturns/Veystrix/releases, including any update the\nLicensor publishes through the application's update feed.\n\n\"Official Build\" means a file published by the Licensor at the address above,\nwhose SHA-256 checksum matches the checksum the Licensor published for it and\nwhose code signature verifies against the Licensor's Developer ID.\n\n\"Model Checkpoint\" means a machine-learning model, weights or tokenizer that you\nobtain from anyone other than the Licensor. Model Checkpoints are not part of\nthe Software.\n\n\"You\" means the person or organization that installs or uses the Software.\n\n2. GRANT OF LICENSE\n\nSubject to this agreement, the Licensor grants You a worldwide, non-exclusive,\nnon-transferable, revocable (for breach, see section 10), royalty-free license\nto download, install and run Official Builds of the Software on computers that\nYou own or control, for any lawful purpose, including personal, educational and\ncommercial use of the Software and of the text it generates.\n\nNo payment, account, registration or network activation is required to use the\nSoftware. The Software is designed to run fully offline once installed.\n\n3. REDISTRIBUTION\n\nYou may share an Official Build with others only if ALL of the following hold:\n(a) the file is unmodified, byte for byte, and its checksum and code signature\nstill verify;\n(b) You provide it free of charge, with no fee, subscription, advertising,\nbundle, donation wall or other consideration tied to it; and\n(c) You keep this agreement and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md with it, and tell the\nrecipient that the official source is the Releases page named in section 1.\n\nYou may always link to the official Releases page.\n\n4. WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO\n\nUnless the Licensor gives You separate written permission, You may not:\n(a) modify, translate, adapt or create derivative works of the Software, or\nrepackage it, or distribute any modified or repackaged version;\n(b) rename, rebrand or present a modified build as Veystrix, use the name\n\"Veystrix\", its logo or its icons in a way that suggests a build is official or\nendorsed, or publish a build that could reasonably be mistaken for an Official\nBuild;\n(c) sell, rent, lease, sublicense or charge for the Software, an Official Build,\nor access to either, or include the Software in a paid product or paid\ncollection;\n(d) remove or alter copyright, license, attribution or update-signature\nnotices;\n(e) disable, bypass or forge the code-signature or update-signature checks in\norder to distribute or install an altered build; or\n(f) distribute the Software in a manner that violates export-control or other\nlaws that apply to You.\n\n5. RIGHTS THAT CANNOT BE WAIVED; THIRD-PARTY RIGHTS\n\nNothing in this agreement limits any right that the law of Your country gives You\nand that cannot be removed by contract. In particular, and to the extent\napplicable law gives them to You, nothing here prevents You from: making a\nbackup copy needed to use the Software; observing, studying and testing how the\nSoftware functions while